COPY public.components_shared_left_expendables (id, heading, description) FROM stdin;
3	03. Our Vision	Vision Statement for Hell Energy Distributing:** Hell Energy’s vision is to build a powerful and reliable global distribution network that makes our energy drinks accessible to every consumer, anytime and anywhere. We aim to become the most trusted and efficient distributor in the beverage industry by delivering excellence, innovation, and consistency. Through strong partnerships, advanced logistics, and a commitment to quality, our vision is to energize the world—one distribution channel at a time—while supporting the growth of our partners and satisfying the dynamic needs of our customers.
1	01. Our History	Hell Energy is a Hungarian energy drink brand founded in 2006 by Barna Békéssy. It began as a family-owned company with the vision of offering premium-quality energy drinks at affordable prices. Within a few years, Hell became Hungary’s top energy drink brand and quickly expanded to international markets. By 2010, it had entered several European and Asian countries. Hell Energy officially launched in **India in 2018**, introducing its popular flavors like Classic, Apple, and Sugar-Free to Indian consumers. The brand gained attention for its bold taste, strong branding, and competitive pricing. In 2011, it built one of Europe’s most advanced beverage factories in Hungary, and by 2017, it opened its own can manufacturing plant, Quality Pack. Hell’s presence in India has grown steadily, with increasing availability in retail stores and online platforms. Today, Hell Energy operates in over 60 countries, including India, and ranks among Europe’s leading energy drink brands.
2	02. Our Mission	Hell Energy’s distribution mission focuses on delivering high-quality energy drinks efficiently and consistently to consumers across the globe. The company aims to build a strong and reliable distribution network that ensures its products are available in every region where there is demand. By combining advanced production technology with an extensive logistics system, Hell Energy maintains freshness and quality from factory to shelf. In India and other international markets, the brand partners with trusted distributors and retailers to expand its reach and accessibility. Its mission is not only to provide energizing beverages but also to create lasting relationships with distributors, ensuring mutual growth and success. Through innovation, speed, and commitment, Hell Energy continues to strengthen its global distribution network and make its products easily available to everyone who seeks energy and performance.
